file caravan/ladder_checks.rye holds the lifted spine -- one entry, four movements, and the tally helper that reads a step's count from whichever form the rung publishes
file caravan/refer.rye through caravan/refrain.rye twenty-one rungs publish the symbols the spine reaches and keep four lines at the callsite rather than a copy of the order
file tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_spine_scan.sh ceiling lowered 1,100 to 40 and its prose brought in sync -- the meter stopped sizing a cost and became the wall that keeps the fold folded
file tools/caravan_ladder_spine_witness.rish asserts the post-fold reading on metal, holds the unmoved copy meter beside it, and keeps the by-hand corpus so the living zero stays meaningful
file tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_harness_prose_scan.sh REDS %100 -- the pattern narrowed to the reach the rule names, so English keeps its own word and a lift still cannot slip through
file tools/caravan_ladder_copy_witness.rish adds the PASS control proving a sentence closing on the ordinary noun is welcomed, beside the two planted refusals
file crux/REDS.md books and closes REDS %100, tally synced to 100 rows
file active-designing/20260820-204641_caravan-ladder-the-spine-the-meter-cannot-see.md status LANDED with the before-and-after table and the cost that arrived unnamed
file caravan/README.md the front door carries both meters and where the spine went
file crux/REMEMBER.md live edge refreshed to fold D, the measuring lap condensed into it
recommend keep-going the ladder's carry is zero on both meters and the harness answers for a rung's silence in checks and in orchestration alike, so the next rung of the correspondence arc costs three lines in one file plus its own step. The constructive door is that next rung -- the movement still growing is where every rung this arc has built earns its keep, and it is now the cheapest it has ever been to extend.
